        <mxCell id="note" value="Read this top-to-bottom: a request enters at the Client, passes through cross-cutting Middleware, is handled by a Route/Controller,&#10;which delegates reusable logic to a Service, which reads/writes a Model, which is persisted to MongoDB (or calls an external API)." style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
